# Trapped in the Screen can target an enchantment an opponent controls. On turn two Bot2's Web Up exiles Bot1's Ornithopter. On
# turn three Bot1 targets Web Up (beside Bot2's Moxen, which are also legal) and exiles it: Web Up has left the battlefield, so
# its own exile ends (CR 610.3) and Ornithopter returns to Bot1, while Web Up stays exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Trapped in the Screen
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Web Up
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Web Up.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Exile = Ornithopter
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Trapped in the Screen.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Web Up)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Web Up
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.SummoningSick = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 3
